        "docstring": "Read the seed file, then fetch up to `limit` users from postgres.\nReturns the raw row objects.",
        "source": "async function queryUsers(limit): Promise<unknown[]> {\n  const seed = await readFile(\"seed.json\", \"utf-8\");\n  const sql = `select * from ${TABLE} limit $1`;\n  const result = await pool.query(sql, [limit]);\n  return result.rows;\n}"
